ormance on and off the hardwood. Honouring all parts of your personality with an out-of-the-box style, the adidas Anthony Edwards 1 keeps up with your hard cuts, groovy moves, crossover dribbles, and every other action.</p> <ul> <li>Durable rubber outsole provides maximum traction and support.</li> </ul>\",\"metaKeywords\":\"adidas Anthony Edwards 1 IG6670\",\"isVirtualPageView\":true,\"alternative_referrer\":\"\"},\"visit\":{\"ecid\":\"60378609790767878130707580152437868498\",\"lastActivity\":1728187197346,\"lastVisitActivity\":false,\"start\":1728187114500,\"number\":1},\"cookie_count_size\":\"cookie_count:55,cookie_size:4183\",\"zendesk\":\"\",\"browser_tab_state\":\"hidden:false|focus:true\",\"currency\":\"USD\",\"ga_session_id\":\"1728187115\",\"user\":{\"ecid\":\"60378609790767878130707580152437868498\",\"language\":\"en\",\"age\":\"\",\"locale\":\"en_US\",\"logged_in\":false,\"previously_logged_in\":false,\"banner_user_flag\":\"\",\"affinity_segments\":\"segment=productgender:mens,segment=productgenderage:men's\",\"searchMetaExperiments\":{},\"ga4_clientId\":\"1306001414.1728187115\",\"is_returning_customer\":\"New\"},\"spa\":{\"config\":{\"useZGWCart\":true,\"useZGWProduct\":true},\"is_limited_web\":false,\"banner_key\":\"FL\",\"launch_build\":\"2.23.0|5.5.0|server side id|2.10.2|none|2024-09-30t22:17:39z|production|dct web sites\",\"flx_enabled\":true,\"sessionId\":\"<REDACTED>\",\"mystoreId\":\"0307861\"},\"marketing\":{\"lastChannel\":\"direct\",\"facebook\":{\"fbp\":\"fb.1.1728187114540.507364\"},\"siteId\":\"\",\"campaignSid\":\"\",\"bluecore_distinctId\":\"1925ffab2db1015-0f5aebe0eb6664-16525637-13c680-1925ffab2dcfee\"},\"privacy\":{\"consent_status\":{\"performance\":{\"name\":\"pc\",\"status\":1},\"functional\":{\"name\":\"fc\",\"status\":1},\"targeting\":{\"name\":\"tc\",\"status\":1},\"DNT\":{\"name\":\"dnt\",\"status\":0},\"GPC\":{\"name\":\"gpc\",\"status\":0},\"geo\":{\"name\":\"geo\",\"status\":0},\"ccpa\":{\"name\":\"cs\",\"status\":1},\"tou\"