{"id": "f083054811eb97a0d4a1a09a", "state": "POST /fragments/basketFragment HTTP/1.1\nHost: <HOST>\ncontent-type: application/json\n\n{\"basketData\":{\"id\":\"45fd4959-be01-48f1-b1b6-ed0042306292:1728669166642\",\"chargePrice\":{\"displayValue\":\"£179.00\",\"amount\":\"179.00\"},\"standardPrice\":{\"displayValue\":\"£212.16\",\"amount\":\"212.16\"},\"discount\":{\"displayValue\":\"£33.16\",\"amount\":\"33.16\"},\"merged\":false,\"selectYourSample\":[{\"id\":\"1229961\",\"title\":null,\"message\":\"4 Free Gifts on every order\",\"currentAmountSpent\":{\"displayValue\":\"£179.00\",\"amount\":\"179.00\"},\"tiers\":[{\"id\":\"0\",\"additionalSpendToReach\":{\"displayValue\":\"£0.00\",\"amount\":\"0.00\"},\"maxSelectedProducts\":4,\"selectedSysProducts\":{\"products\":[],\"productVariants\":[]},\"sysProducts\":{\"products\":[{\"sku\":15363161,\"title\":\"Fiit - Get 60 days free on FIIT, plus 25% off any membership!\",\"images\":[{\"original\":\"https://static.thcdn.com/productimg/original/15363161-7185183849090115.jpg\"}],\"content\":[{\"key\":\"synopsis\",\"value\":{\"__typename\":\"ProductContentRichContentListValue\",\"richContentListValue\":[{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"HTML\",\"content\":\"<p>Get 60 days free on FIIT, worth £40. Plus 25% OFF any membership!</p>\\n<p>This October, we challenge you to start strong. Why wait for 'New Year, new me'? Step into the new year as your best self. Complete 5 FIIT classes in 14 days.&nbsp; At home or in the gym, with their 10-minute movers or 45-minute Game Days, how you move is up to you.</p>\\n<p>Put your protein to good use. Train, recover and compete on FIIT: the UK’s #1 rated fitness platform. Join a Team to achieve your dream, schedule a group class for added motivation, or start a Training Plan to take the guesswork out of your routine. Whenever. Wherever. Begin like you mean to win. Start strong, finish stronger!</p>\\n<p><em>*Complete 5 classes in 14 days to win the Start Strong 5 trophy.</em></p>\\n<p><strong>T&amp;Cs:</strong> Offer valid in the [UK]. This offer is only available to Myprotein customers, excluding anyone who has been a customer of Fiit in the last 12 months. Debit / Credit card required for registration via landing page <a href=\\\"https://getfiit.tv/myprotein\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://getfiit.tv/myprotein</a>. At the end of the 60 day free trial period, you will automatically be charged the first payment of your chosen subscription, which will continue to be charged periodically until you cancel. 25% discount applies to first subscription payment only. Subscribers must be 16 years or over. Offer cannot be exchanged, refunded, transferred or used in conjunction with any other offer. The promotion will end at 23:59:59 UK time on 31/07/2024. Find full app terms here: fiit.tv/terms-and-conditions.</p>\"}]}]}},{\"key\":\"brand\",\"value\":{\"__typename\":\"ProductContentStringListValue\",\"stringListValue\":[\"Fiit\"]}}]},{\"sku\":15366400,\"title\":\"Gousto - 65% off your first box and 25% off for two months\",\"images\":[{\"original\":\"https://static.thcdn.com/productimg/original/15366400-5145143374253479.jpg\"}],\"content\":[{\"key\":\"synopsis\",\"value\":{\"__typename\":\"ProductContentRichContentListValue\",\"richContentListValue\":[{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"HTML\",\"content\":\"<p>Gousto gives you everything you need to create mouthwatering home-cooked meals from scratch, including perfectly portioned fresh ingredients and easy to follow instructions.</p>\\n<ul>\\n <li>Choose from over 250 recipes every month</li>\\n <li>Select from calorie controlled meals to protein hits</li>\\n <li>Dish up delicious dinners in as little as 10 mins</li>\\n</ul>\"}]}]}},{\"key\":\"brand\",\"value\":{\"__typename\":\"ProductContentStringListValue\",\"stringListValue\":[\"Gousto\"]}}]},{\"sku\":15591555,\"title\":\"Naked Wines - £80 off at Naked Wines and FREE bottle of fizz!\",\"images\":[{\"original\":\"https://static.thcdn.com/productimg/original/15591555-1925180490502563.jpg\"}],\"content\":[{\"key\":\"synopsis\",\"value\":{\"__typename\":\"ProductContentRichContentListValue\",\"richContentListValue\":[{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"HTML\",\"content\":\"<p>Enjoy a tasty £80 off your first case of Naked Wines - plus FREE bottle of fizz!</p>\\n<p>Take the guesswork out of wine today! Discover 12 delicious bottles + 1 FREE bottle of fizz made by the world's best independent winemakers for just £59.99...</p>\\n<p>Order today and you'll also get FREE speedy delivery to your door.</p>\\n<p>What's more, every bottle is covered by Naked's 100% hassle-free guarantee - never pay for a wine you don't love again!</p>\"}]}]}},{\"key\":\"brand\",\"value\":{\"__typename\":\"ProductContentStringListValue\",\"stringListValue\":[\"Myprotein\"]}}]},{\"sku\":14538419,\"title\":\"Amazon Music – 30 Days FREE!\",\"images\":[{\"original\":\"https://static.thcdn.com/productimg/original/14538419-3905156908735917.jpg\"}],\"content\":[{\"key\":\"synopsis\",\"value\":{\"__typename\":\"ProductContentRichContentListValue\",\"richContentListValue\":[{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"HTML\",\"content\":\"<ul>\\n <li>100 million songs in HD</li>\\n <li>Pick and play your favourite songs, ad-free.</li>\\n <li>The most ad-free top podcasts</li>\\n <li>Amazon Originals (Exclusive songs and podcasts)</li>\\n <li>Personalized Stations and thousands of playlists</li>\\n <li>Ultra HD and Spatial Audio</li>\\n <li>Listen offline</li>\\n <li>Unlimited skips</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>T&amp;CS:</strong>&nbsp;Disclaimer: £10.99/month after (£9.99/month for Prime members) incl. VAT. New subscribers only. Renews automatically. Offer ends 30/09/2024. Terms apply.&nbsp;</p>\"}]}]}},{\"key\":\"brand\",\"value\":{\"__typename\":\"ProductContentStringListValue\",\"stringListValue\":[\"Myprotein\"]}}]}],\"productVariants\":[{\"sku\":15366400,\"title\":\"Gousto - 65% off your first box and 25% off for two months\",\"images\":[{\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.thcdn.com/productimg/70/70/15366400